{
  "duration": 75.259,
  "phrases": [
    {
      "start": 0.099,
      "end": 0.28,
      "text": "So"
    },
    {
      "start": 0.699,
      "end": 1.759,
      "text": "welcome back again."
    },
    {
      "start": 2.279,
      "end": 3.22,
      "text": "It's time to solve"
    },
    {
      "start": 3.759,
      "end": 4.46,
      "text": "one more problem."
    },
    {
      "start": 4.92,
      "end": 5.659,
      "text": "In this problem,"
    },
    {
      "start": 6.119,
      "end": 6.96,
      "text": "we are given that"
    },
    {
      "start": 7.399,
      "end": 9.92,
      "text": "sine theta is equal to cos two theta"
    },
    {
      "start": 10.38,
      "end": 12.039,
      "text": "and theta is an acute angle."
    },
    {
      "start": 12.599,
      "end": 15.299,
      "text": "The question is asking us to find the value of theta."
    },
    {
      "start": 15.759,
      "end": 17.76,
      "text": "Now, this is a very easy multiple choice question."
    },
    {
      "start": 18.18,
      "end": 20.459,
      "text": "Can we solve it by checking the options directly?"
    },
    {
      "start": 20.92,
      "end": 21.18,
      "text": "Yes,"
    },
    {
      "start": 21.6,
      "end": 21.959,
      "text": "we can."
    },
    {
      "start": 22.779,
      "end": 24.139,
      "text": "Let us check option A,"
    },
    {
      "start": 24.579,
      "end": 25.879,
      "text": "which is forty-five degrees."
    },
    {
      "start": 26.34,
      "end": 30.419,
      "text": "If theta is forty-five degrees, then sine forty-five degrees is equal to one by root two."
    },
    {
      "start": 30.799,
      "end": 32.259,
      "text": "Now, let us check the right side."
    },
    {
      "start": 32.659,
      "end": 36.38,
      "text": "Cos two theta becomes cos ninety degrees,"
    },
    {
      "start": 36.819,
      "end": 37.799,
      "text": "which is equal to zero."
    },
    {
      "start": 38.36,
      "end": 39.779,
      "text": "These two values are not the same,"
    },
    {
      "start": 40.259,
      "end": 41.559,
      "text": "so option A is not correct."
    },
    {
      "start": 41.919,
      "end": 44.199,
      "text": "Now, let us check option B, which is thirty degrees."
    },
    {
      "start": 44.68,
      "end": 49.0,
      "text": "If theta is thirty degrees, then sine thirty degrees is equal to one-half."
    },
    {
      "start": 49.559,
      "end": 50.359,
      "text": "On the right side,"
    },
    {
      "start": 50.779,
      "end": 55.959,
      "text": "cos two theta becomes cos sixty degrees, which is also equal to one-half."
    },
    {
      "start": 56.399,
      "end": 58.179,
      "text": "Now, both sides are giving the same value."
    },
    {
      "start": 58.699,
      "end": 59.959,
      "text": "The left side is one by two."
    },
    {
      "start": 60.5,
      "end": 62.039,
      "text": "The right side is also one by two."
    },
    {
      "start": 62.639,
      "end": 64.58,
      "text": "So the given condition is satisfied."
    },
    {
      "start": 65.099,
      "end": 65.619,
      "text": "Got it?"
    },
    {
      "start": 66.319,
      "end": 66.799,
      "text": "Perfect."
    },
    {
      "start": 67.639,
      "end": 68.099,
      "text": "Hence,"
    },
    {
      "start": 68.699,
      "end": 71.5,
      "text": "the value of theta is thirty degrees."
    },
    {
      "start": 72.019,
      "end": 73.68,
      "text": "So the final answer will be option B,"
    },
    {
      "start": 74.299,
      "end": 75.259,
      "text": "thirty degrees."
    }
